self administered medications typically take only about half their prescribed doses. Efforts to assist patients with    
adherence to medications might improve the benefits of prescribed medications.", "selection_criteria": "We included     
unconfounded RCTs of interventions to improve adherence with prescribed medications, measuring both medication adherence
