      "decision": "INCLUDE",                                                                                            
      "rationale": "RCT of family intervention for schizophrenic patients. Abstract indicates regular medication use    
  was assessed (stratified analysis shows medication use and family intervention had independent effects). Clinical     
  outcomes include hospital readmission and functioning. 18-month follow-up meets duration requirement.",               
      "confidence": "high"                                                                                              
